 ### 3D Noise Generation with Box Filtering
-Generates a 3D tiling noise volume by applying a 3×3×3 box blur to hide trilinear interpolation artifacts [S23, unofficial]. Chosen for seamless procedural volumes. Uses a seeded PRNG to initialize random values, averages the 3×3×3 neighborhood for each voxel, and wraps coordinates modulo dimension for tiling [S23, unofficial].
