 ### Derivative Erosion FBM
-Accumulates derivatives across octaves to dampen amplitude via `1/(1+|grad|^2)` [S24]. Chosen for realistic erosion patterns where steep slopes remain smooth [S24]. Updates frequency, amplitude, and position rotation per octave [S24].
